WEBVTT

00:25:57.007 --> 00:26:02.543
the most exciting one is to see 
those young entrepreneurs on the stage

00:26:02.543 --> 00:26:06.554
having the courage of saying,
"We are really part of that globe

00:26:06.554 --> 00:26:10.312
we have great ideas, 
and we are happy to present those."

00:26:10.968 --> 00:26:14.423
Thank you. That's a beautiful way 
to end this conversation.

00:26:14.423 --> 00:26:17.568
I look forward with my colleagues 
to see this partnership develop,

00:26:17.568 --> 00:26:20.218
to meeting you
and your colleagues in Doha,

00:26:20.218 --> 00:26:22.448
and, of course, 
I thank the Qatar Foundation

00:26:22.448 --> 00:26:25.798
for its support of TED's mission.

00:26:25.798 --> 00:26:28.505
Dr. Hasnah, thank you very much 
for taking the time.

00:26:28.861 --> 00:26:32.131
And to those who have been listening,
thank you for listening.